https://github.com/crillab/d4
o, for an OR node
f, for a false leaf
t, for a true leaf
a, for an AND node 

The second argument just after the type of node is its index.

In the example the decision-DNNF representation has
3 OR nodes (1, 2 and 3) and 1 true node (4).

o 1 0
o 2 0
o 3 0
t 4 0
3 4 -2 3 0
3 4 2 0
2 3 -1 0
2 4 1 0
1 2 0
